# `view.patch_session`

Patch a fragment in the caller's view session.

**Policy** — command `[C1_WORKSPACE]`. Capability `ship.views.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type | required |
|------|------|----------|
| `id` | `string` | yes |
| `selector` | `string` | yes |
| `html` | `string` | yes |

## Returns

Status JSON (the mutation result).

## Invoke

